# TypeScript

- `strict` plus `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`. No `any`. Narrow `unknown` at boundaries.
- Import types and values from `@tender/shared` for roles and statuses.
- Named exports. One domain concept per file in packages.
- Do not catch-and-swallow. Log and rethrow a typed error at service edges.

```ts
// ❌
status: string
role: string

// ✅
import type { TenderStatus, AppRole } from "@tender/shared";
```
